#
#   paintable_with_lines_2 - Painting::PaintableWithLines: text decorations
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/PaintableWithLines.cpp (lines 482-817): the segments of an
#       underline or overline that skip the glyphs' ink (text-decoration-skip-ink), painting
#       the decoration lines of a span (underline, overline and line-through in the solid,
#       double, dashed, dotted and wavy styles, spelling and grammar errors) and the triangle
#       wave path of wavy lines.
